efers using brains, not strength and likes to bet with opponents using different tricks which some may not find ethical."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3885"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。馴染み仲間内での参謀役。陽気でおしゃべり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人と人とのつながりを大事にしているため、色々な所に顔がきく。が、それらは知人に過ぎず、「友達」は幼馴染達に限定されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝利を得るためには過程は問わないタイプで、何かを成し遂げるために作戦を立てる事を好む頭脳派。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本おちゃらけている。頭がいいというより、効率がいいので成績も良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘力の高い女性陣を頭脳で対抗しようとするが、たいていイジられて終わる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ずるい？　褒め言葉どーも」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17301","sourceWorkId":"11236","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。青梅竹马团体里的参谋。阳光而爱说话。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为注重人与人之间的联系，不但在自己班里，甚至其他的班以及年级都有认识的人，相当有人缘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"属于为了胜利不问过程的类型，喜欢做事前定下作战计划的头脑派。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"该出手时就出手，不过因为总不在状态，基本上都不愿承担责任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"用头脑来对抗战斗力极高的女性们的时候，基本上都以被捉弄为告终。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11739"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62dcd18d986dbfee58b60b13a4d38ce17922cf82fabd3c8f043a999a28dc66cd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c611a8deb45c8d5b89c789c87747fa631dfb40799d9732e7d7537f31c0edceb1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c55455","characterName":"リザ・ブリンカー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c55455"},"originalCharacterName":"リザ・ブリンカー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"309"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewSt